# release.md — Template definition (release process)

## Expression

- Register process and results only; no explanation
- High-risk operations (L3): separate request + item-by-item confirmation
- Rollback guarantee: state rollback method before executing

## Section hierarchy

### H1 (required)
- Release record

### H2 (required)
- Version & target: version / date / release target
- Build record table: step / command / result / evidence
- Deploy record table: step / operation / result / rollback method

### H3 (required)
- none

## Optional sections

- [optional] Pre-release check: regression list / confirmation record
- [optional] Changelog: date / change
